    "## 4. Dimensionality Reduction & Quantum Feature Scaling\n",
    "Quantum circuits on NISQ simulators require a compact qubit count ($N=4$ qubits):\n",
    "1. **StandardScaler:** Centers features to zero mean and unit variance.\n",
    "2. **PCA ($N=4$):** Projects the multi-channel EEG feature space into 4 principal components capturing the largest variance.\n",
    "3. **MinMaxScaler ($[0, \\pi]$):** Rescales the components to $[0, \\pi]$ to serve directly as phase rotation angles in quantum gates."
