    "## 11. Discussion & Conclusions for Challenge 02\n",
    "\n",
    "### Key Takeaways\n",
    "1. **Quantum Circuit Integration:** We successfully engineered an end-to-end pipeline that transforms continuous biological signals (EEG spectral bands) into quantum state parameters via `ZZFeatureMap` and optimizes a parameterized ansatz via classical feedback (`VQC`).\n",
    "2. **Feature Space Exploration:** The non-linear interactions captured by the $ZZ$ entanglement gates map the correlations between low (Delta/Theta) and high (Alpha/Beta) frequency rhythms into a 16-dimensional Hilbert state space.\n",
    "3. **Clinical Relevance:** In healthcare classification, high sensitivity (recall) is critical to prevent false-negative discharge of patients with cognitive decline.\n",
    "4. **NISQ Realities:** Classical models execute in milliseconds, while quantum simulators require iterative circuit sampling. As hardware scales and error mitigation improves, quantum kernels and deeper ansatz designs hold potential for high-dimensional biomedical correlations."
   ]
  }
 ],
